{"id": "tea:tripura-rahasya:jnana", "source": "src:tripura-rahasya", "location": {"ref": "jnana"}, "paraphrase": "Through the story of Prince Hemacūḍa, taught by his wife Hemalekhā, the text teaches that bondage is only lack of inquiry and that the self is pure consciousness which illumines and knows itself.", "tags": {"level": "bridging", "standpoint": "seeker", "naya": null, "path": ["knowledge"], "stage": "all"}, "types": ["teacher-transmission", "consciousness-mind"], "practices": ["prc:atma-vicara"], "notes": "Jñāna-khaṇḍa, opening chapters; chapter-level.", "teachers": ["tch:haritayana"], "reported_by_opponent": false, "fidelity": {"status": "unchecked"}, "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": ["U13-advaita"], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "low", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U13-advaita"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:tripura-rahasya:jnana/2", "source": "src:tripura-rahasya", "location": {"ref": "jnana"}, "paraphrase": "The world appears within consciousness like a city reflected in a mirror; consciousness has the power of self-awareness (vimarśa) by which it knows itself and projects the world.", "tags": {"level": "bridging", "standpoint": "absolute", "naya": null, "path": ["knowledge"], "stage": "advanced"}, "types": ["ultimate", "world-fate"], "concepts": ["cpt:reflection-analogy"], "teachers": ["tch:haritayana"], "reported_by_opponent": false, "fidelity": {"status": "unchecked"}, "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": ["U13-advaita"], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "low", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U13-advaita"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:tripura-rahasya:jnana/3", "source": "src:tripura-rahasya", "location": {"ref": "jnana"}, "paraphrase": "The highest knower is not one who must enter samādhi to be free, but one whose realization remains unbroken in activity and in samādhi alike (the natural state).", "tags": {"level": "ultimate", "standpoint": "experiential", "naya": null, "path": ["knowledge"], "stage": "realized"}, "types": ["powers-experiences", "karma-liberation"], "concepts": ["cpt:jivanmukta-marks"], "teachers": ["tch:haritayana"], "reported_by_opponent": false, "fidelity": {"status": "unchecked"}, "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": ["U13-advaita"], "disagreements": []}, "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "low", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U13-advaita"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
